 and PD handling

Consolidate the external OTG, DRP, PMIC supply, cable detection, PD source/sink and startup reconciliation changes.

Consolidated from local follow-ups:
  0c0f76f665f8003ac89cad71c64d826e1f2ef186 power: supply: qcom_battmgr: control Dodge external OTG power
