  e731c2ebcaf0a992c934af9c9ae1af1600c4eda5 power: supply: qcom_battmgr: support bounded Dodge PD sink requests
  c8e5be5af1e29675569c8de9c2bd0528ab0bfe10 power: supply: qcom_battmgr: reconcile Dodge cable state at startup
